meta {
  name: 01. Create Group
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "title": "Weekend trip",
    "description": "just test",
    "cover_attachment_id": null
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
}

docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth
  
  `POST /api/v1/groups` — Bearer access token required.
  
  ## Description
  
  Creates a group and adds the requester as its owner and first member.
  
  ## Request
  
  ### Headers
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |
  
  ### Body
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `title` | `string` | Yes | Group title, 1–150 characters. |
  | `description` | `string` | No | Group description, up to 5000 characters. |
  | `cover_attachment_id` | `integer` | No | Optional ID of an existing uploaded attachment of type `GROUP_COVER` to set as the group's cover/profile image. |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 42,
      "title": "Weekend trip",
      "description": "just test",
      "created_by_user_id": 7,
      "cover_attachment_id": 15,
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "is_premium": false,
      "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
      "member_count": 1
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  - `400 GROUP_INVALID_PAYLOAD` — Missing or invalid title/description/cover_attachment_id.
  - `400 INVALID_FILE_TYPE` — Referenced attachment is not of type `GROUP_COVER`.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `404 ATTACHMENT_NOT_FOUND` — Referenced `cover_attachment_id` does not exist.
  - `500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` — Group could not be created.
}
